	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "AfhXM_LTgyte4TdrP",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the reviewed package: ST 20, DX 10, IQ 12, HT 12, HP 20, WILL 14, PER 14, FP 12, SPEED 5.5, MOVE 8, DODGE 8, DR 2. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "A03K76Vb2pim8VigI",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 46 (offense 28, protection 18), threat tier standard, appearing 1."
		},
		{
			"id": "AjszrDGwEAOh3GiFD",
			"text": "Roar: When a creature hears the roar of an androsphinx, it must roll a Fright Check at a -2 penalty. If a victim succeeds at his Fright Check, he will be unaffected by this ability for one hour."
		},
